 n. A flower of that grass, K.S.vii.11, R.iv.17.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "काश(स) (III) m. 1. Cough, catarrh, काशाश्रुलालाविलः Sant.S.ii.29; 2. sneezing.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कास m. Cough, catarrh.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कासः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kAsaH"]}, {"id": "kAza", "headword": "काष", "headword_slp1": "kAza", "fold": "kasa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "काष m. 1. Rubbing, पथिषु विटपिनां स्कंदधकाषैः सधूमः Ve.ii.; 2. that against which anything is rubbed, लीनालिः सुरकरिणां कपोलकाषः Kir.v.26, (काषः कषणस्थानं द्रुमस्कंधादि Mall.).", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["काषं", "काषः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kAzaM", "kAzaH"]}, {"id": "kAsA", "headword": "कासा", "headword_slp1": "kAsA", "fold": "kasa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कासा f. Cough, catarrh.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kasipu": [{"id": "kaSipu", "headword": "कशिपु", "headword_slp1": "kaSipu", "fold": "kasipu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कशिपु (I) m.n. 1. A mat; 2. bed.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कशिपु (II) m. 1. Food; 2. clothing; (according to विश्व, however, it means ‘food and clothing’ together.)", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कशिपुः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kaSipuH"]}], "kaseru": [{"id": "kaSeru", "headword": "कशेरु", "headword_slp1": "kaSeru", "fold": "kaseru", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कशे(से)रु m.n. 1. The back bone; 2. a kind of grass.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कशेरुः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kaSeruH"]}, {"id": "kaseru", "headword": "कसेरु", "headword_slp1": "kaseru", "fold": "kaseru", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कशे(से)रु m.n. 1. The back bone; 2. a kind of grass.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कसेरुः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kaseruH"]}], "kasmala": [{"id": "kaSmala", "headword": "कश्मल", "headword_slp1"